text: >
  Marauding Captain: You treat all those who work under your command as expendable.
  –Prerequisites: Herans, Cutthroat Teamwork
  (1)-[Passive]: For Cutthroat Teamwork, ignore the ‘(that is not a Minion)’ parts of that Trait’s effects.
  (2)-[Passive]: All of your Minions have their Soak Value increased by 1(T).

